<title>JAPAN: Sekisui Plastics - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sekisui Plastics - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 34.56		vs	   33.39</p>
<p> Operating	prft 106 million    vs   loss 299    million</p>
<p> Current	  prft 395 million    vs   loss 345    million</p>
<p> Net		  265    million    vs	  361    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.59 yen	  vs	    3.52 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    102 million	  vs	 102 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sekisui Plastics Co Ltd is a manufacturer of foam plastics.</p>
